pageType: content
notes: |
  市场页：目标用户与为什么现在。价值主张是同一条链路 Replay 已跑通、Live 开发中。
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: corner
    elementType: text
    bounds: [792, 12, 104, 58]
    content:
      style: "$cornerNum"
      align: [right, top]
      text: "13"
  - elementId: tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 44, 22, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [96, 36, 600, 16]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      text: MARKET · WHY NOW · 12
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 56, 832, 40]
    content:
      style: "$display"
      fontSize: 26
      text: 服务有认知、缺工具的期权用户，市场窗口已经打开
  - elementId: standfirst
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 100, 832, 18]
    content:
      style: "$standfirst"
      text: 价值主张：从一句自然语言到可核验的决策卡，Replay 与 Live 同一条链路；数字带来源与审计链
  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 124, 832, 1]
    viewBox: [832, 1]
    points: "0,0 832,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: user-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 140, 420, 276]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: user-rail
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 140, 3, 276]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: user-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 154, 380, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      bold: true
      text: 目标用户
  - elementId: user-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 178, 380, 116]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: |
        <p>会用 Futu、理解 Call/Put 与基本风险，</p>
        <p>但缺少专业终端与完整量化流程的港美股期权投资者。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">核心任务：</p>
        <p>· 把「业绩将近、方向不确定、最多亏 5%」转成完整研究任务</p>
        <p>· 快速知道成本、盈亏边界、IV crush、流动性与账户影响</p>
        <p>· 明确为什么交易、暂缓或停止，并回到原始数据与计算依据</p>
  - elementId: user-kpi
    elementType: text
    bounds: [84, 320, 380, 66]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: |
        <p><strong style="font-size:16px; color:$primary;">P0a</strong>　Replay 已端到端跑通（无需 Futu 账户）</p>
        <p><strong style="font-size:16px; color:$primary;">P0b</strong>　Live 同链路接入实时行情（开发中）</p>
  - elementId: why1-dot
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [520, 150, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: why1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [538, 144, 358, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      bold: true
      text: 数据基础设施成熟
  - elementId: why1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [538, 164, 358, 34]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: 富途 OpenAPI + 官方 futuapi Skill 开放实时行情、期权链与模拟盘，个人开发者首次能构建机构式流程
  - elementId: why2-dot
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [520, 218, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: why2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [538, 212, 358, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      bold: true
      text: LLM 工具调用成熟
  - elementId: why2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [538, 232, 358, 34]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: 自然语言场景解析 + 工具编排可用，但「会算数」仍需确定性引擎兜底，Agent 层成为增量
  - elementId: why3-dot
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [520, 286, 8, 8]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: why3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [538, 280, 358, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      bold: true
      text: 港美股期权散户化
  - elementId: why3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [538, 300, 358, 34]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: 港股个股期权美式/实物交割与 IV crush 让「模板化工具」频繁出错，需要规则显性化的决策支持
  - elementId: gap-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 350, 376, 42]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      color: "$sub"
      text: 市场缺口：Bloomberg 式的流程能力，零售价格 + 中文优先；竞品多为单点计算器或预警，缺账户约束与审计闭环。
  - elementId: quote-rail
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 434, 3, 46]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: quote-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 450, 800, 26]
    content:
      style: "$quote"
      text: '<p><span style="font-size:20px; color:$primary;">“</span>用户不缺一个计算器，缺的是一个能负责的决策流程。</p>'
  - elementId: takeaway-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 490, 832, 1]
    viewBox: [832, 1]
    points: "0,0 832,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: takeaway-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 493, 832, 24]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 10.5
      color: "$sub"
      text: 切入点是业绩事件跨式：高频、规则复杂、IV crush 后果直观；产品先把「敢说不交易」做成可验证的闭环，再扩展标的与策略。
  - elementId: footer-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 524, 832, 1]
    viewBox: [832, 1]
    points: "0,0 832,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 521, 650, 19]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: 来源：docs/PRD.md §1 用户与痛点 · research/01-market-landscape.md
  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [704, 521, 192, 19]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 13 / 16
